  "description": "GitHub's published example payloads, vendored so that the tests never reach the network (spec 0001, user story 43). Every file the pinned revision carries under payload-examples/api.github.com is here: the event type is the directory it sits in and the action is what the payload itself carries, so a test reads no table beside it. The digest is of the file as committed and the tests recompute it, so an edited fixture fails rather than quietly changing what the models are said to cover.",
